    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm seeing some weird damage on my tomato plants in the greenhouse. there are these tiny, irregular holes appearing on the leaves, mostly on the older ones. it looks like something is chewing through them but i can't seem to find anything crawling on the plants when i check. any idea what might be causing this?",
