    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the undersides but didnt see much besides some dust. the holes are really small though, almost like they were poked with a needle or something. they just seem to appear overnight in certain spots. could it be something that only comes out at night?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
